# Starforge — docs authority

## Laws

1. [architecture-current](../../docs/project-context/docs/architecture-current.md) is the live map. It wins over plans, preferences, and chat.
2. Copy an accepted decision into the matching rule, the live map, and the owner README in the same change. Use the [decision template](../../docs/project-context/docs/decision-template.md).
3. Leave open work marked open on the live map. Do not turn it into a rule.
4. Plans stay history. They do not override the live map or the rules.

## Quick check

If a plan, audit, or chat message disagrees with the live map, follow the live map. If a decision lives only in chat or a plan, it is not accepted yet.

